1
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:34,910
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:37,880
[Episode 32]

3
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,650
The antidotes are all here.

4
00:01:49,479 --> 00:01:51,680
You and Li Boze really put on a great show

5
00:01:51,789 --> 00:01:53,070
