6
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,479
But I was up all night
sewing blood packs for you.

7
00:01:55,479 --> 00:01:57,140
The capable must do more work.

8
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:02,440
There is enough antidote for all of us.

9
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,490
How thoughtful of him.

10
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,350
That's not all.

11
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:11,630
There are also aircraft parts
and ammunition.

12
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:23,280
The situation is critical now.

13
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:29,650
[Several days ago]

14
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:25,320
We don't have much time to meet.

15
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:25,960
Tell me,

16
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,780
what are you planning?

17
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:28,970
First of all,

18
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,190
I need you to die.

19
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:35,510
And you have to die in front of everyone.

20
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,750
The Red Pill could spread so widely

21
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,630
because the Zhang family

22
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:44,890
is supported by the Chamber of Commerce.

23
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,740
I will personally kill you

24
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:49,290
as a show of my sincerity
to work for them.

25
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:51,370
In return, I'll receive their trust

26
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:52,470
and the antidote.

27
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,910
You mean...

28
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:59,240
You'll lead the Ying Army to attack
the aviation school,

29
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,400
kill me in person,

30
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:04,480
and take over
all the planes and resources there?

31
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,530
Exactly.

32
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,520
But I'll load a blank

33
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:09,150
in my gun beforehand.

34
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,680
You won't die.

35
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,490
After you fake your death,

36
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,400
the students will definitely
try their best

37
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,660
to take your body away.

38
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:18,510
At this point,

39
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,720
the first step is complete.

40
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,650
And my pledge of loyalty

41
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:24,770
will be thoroughly delivered.

42
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,280
Next,

43
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:31,030
we need to find out the location
of the pharmaceutical factory.

44
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,000
The drugs will be transported

45
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,660
via the North-South Railway.

46
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:36,560
As long as we know the departure time

47
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,400
and pattern,

48
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:41,110
deducing the exact location of the factory

49
00:03:41,630 --> 00:03:42,470
won't be hard.

50
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,150
What about the antidote?

51
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:45,210
After killing you,

52
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,910
I will immediately join
the Chamber of Commerce.

53
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:48,820
We will be considered

54
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:49,960
one of their own.

55
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:53,960
They will naturally give
the Ying Army the antidote.

56
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:57,120
As for your share of the antidote,

57
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:59,240
I will have the Ying Army spare some

58
00:04:00,430 --> 00:04:02,230
and secretly send it over to you.

59
00:04:05,060 --> 00:04:06,560
Spare some antidote?

60
00:04:07,490 --> 00:04:08,890
What about the soldiers?

61
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,450
Don't worry about that.

62
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,310
I will put on a show

63
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,720
with Commander Tang.

64
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,010
While deceiving Zhang Mingshu,

65
00:04:17,010 --> 00:04:18,829
I will arrange for him
to enter the factory

66
00:04:18,829 --> 00:04:21,089
for two-way coordination in the future.

67
00:04:27,510 --> 00:04:29,390
Since their first day in the army,

68
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,720
they have been ready
to sacrifice themselves.

69
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,120
With the antidote,

70
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,270
you can secure

71
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:39,670
some effective strength

72
00:04:40,190 --> 00:04:41,240
to put up a fight.

73
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,040
I will do everything I can

74
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,390
to save a plane for you

75
00:04:46,159 --> 00:04:47,270
and transport it to your area

76
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:48,830
via the North-South Railway.

77
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,760
As for the location of the factory,

78
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,920
I will tell you personally.

79
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,270
No.

80
00:04:54,990 --> 00:04:56,190
It's too risky.

81
00:04:56,430 --> 00:04:57,890
If you are exposed, you...

82
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,160
Don't worry.

83
00:05:09,390 --> 00:05:11,790
I can make someone like you
fake your death,

84
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,220
wouldn't I leave a way out for myself?

85
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,400
Rest assured.

86
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,290
Time is running out.

87
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,240
Wait for my news.

88
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:26,200
Once you take this step,

89
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,080
there's no turning back.

90
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,310
Even if you succeed,

91
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:33,960
you will bear the infamy of a traitor.

92
00:05:34,290 --> 00:05:36,620
Are you sure you've thought this through?

93
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:38,750
At this point,

94
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:42,830
I have to do something.

95
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,980
The three of us brothers are all the same.

96
00:05:51,710 --> 00:05:53,110
It's as if we were all born

97
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:55,120
with a crippling debt.

98
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:04,040
It definitely can't be paid off
in this lifetime.

99
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,560
In the next life,

100
00:06:05,970 --> 00:06:07,370
we'll slowly pay it back.

101
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,090
Second Brother.

102
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:36,950
Take care.

103
00:06:40,159 --> 00:06:42,360
You rarely ever call me Second Brother.

104
00:06:45,950 --> 00:06:47,150
I like the sound of it.

105
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:16,180
[East Asia Chamber of Commerce]

106
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,560
Rest assured, Chairman.

107
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:35,510
The aviation school
is under our control right now.

108
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:37,480
All the school's planes in Nancheng

109
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,870
have been seized by us.

110
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,830
Air combat is impossible for them now.

111
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:45,680
Meanwhile,

112
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,040
