has also been arranged.

113
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,780
Once the Chamber of Commerce
fully evacuates Nancheng,

114
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:55,480
the entire city will be in our hands.

115
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,070
Have you

116
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:04,240
thought of an excuse?

117
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:09,510
We'll say that the recent outbreak of
a strange disease at the aviation school

118
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:11,040
might spread to the public.

119
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:14,390
The Chamber of Commerce and the
Zhang family, out of goodwill,

120
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:17,680
will distribute free medicine
to major hospitals in advance.

121
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,600
We'll also have

122
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,160
the Ying Army deliver the medicine.

123
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,190
This way,

124
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,310
even if the matter is exposed,

125
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,630
we can pin the blame

126
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,830
on Li Boze.

127
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,789
You've thought this through.

128
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,120
After it's done,

129
00:08:42,470 --> 00:08:45,120
the Zhang family will surely be rewarded.

130
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,280
Thank you, Chairman.

131
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,720
Young Marshal Li,

132
00:08:52,870 --> 00:08:53,910
for safety reasons,

133
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:55,370
please hand over your gun.

134
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:23,720
Young Marshal Li, you can go in now.

135
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,000
Thanks.

136
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,410
Awesome!

137
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,320
Awesome!

138
00:09:46,330 --> 00:09:48,530
Awesome! We can fly!

139
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,390
Principal,

140
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,570
the plane is assembled.

141
00:09:50,570 --> 00:09:51,490
Awesome!

142
00:09:51,510 --> 00:09:52,460
Awesome!

143
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,340
Great.

144
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,550
Boze has already settled Qing

145
00:09:58,550 --> 00:09:59,670
at Dongjiadu.

146
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,000
But why is he

147
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:03,880
still in the enemy camp?

148
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,580
He told me he would find out

149
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,220
the location of the pharmaceutical factory

150
00:10:10,220 --> 00:10:11,680
and personally inform me.

151
00:10:22,730 --> 00:10:23,750
Young Marshal Li.

152
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:27,270
The Ying Army will be responsible
for distributing the medicine

153
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:29,200
to these hospitals.

154
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,720
Sure.

155
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:33,440
Where do I get the medicine?

156
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,770
Don't worry about that.

157
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:37,750
At 7 a.m. tomorrow,

158
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,790
3 batches of medicine will arrive at

159
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:41,790
Jiating Station,

160
00:10:42,250 --> 00:10:43,270
Qingqu Station,

161
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:45,280
and Zhanan Station.

162
00:10:45,750 --> 00:10:48,210
You just need to send people
to receive them.

163
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:49,390
Are we taking the North-South Railway?

164
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,030
Yes.

165
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:52,870
Remember,

166
00:10:54,270 --> 00:10:56,630
distribute the medicine at the same time.

167
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,100
The epidemic waits for no one.

168
00:11:00,270 --> 00:11:01,270
Young Marshal Li,

169
00:11:01,550 --> 00:11:02,750
why are you laughing?

170
00:11:03,870 --> 00:11:04,670
It's nothing.

171
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,170
I was just thinking that

172
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,910
this is clearly poison,

173
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:12,150
but you packaged it as a panacea.

174
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:14,910
Chairman,

175
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,270
