176
00:11:18,510 --> 00:11:20,910
If anything goes wrong with this medicine,

177
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:23,530
the Ying Army will become the scapegoat.

178
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,640
What nonsense are you spouting?

179
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,600
Li Boze,

180
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:33,840
from the moment you started
working for us to get the antidote,

181
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:36,770
your reputation as a traitor
was already confirmed.

182
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:40,600
Do you think there's any
turning back for you?

183
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,370
You must distribute

184
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,030
this batch of medicine.

185
00:11:45,150 --> 00:11:46,080
Otherwise,

186
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:49,080
you and the Ying Army
will be buried together.

187
00:12:00,670 --> 00:12:03,270
If I hadn't confirmed
my identity as a traitor,

188
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,260
how would you have trusted me?

189
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,720
And how would you have told me

190
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:10,680
the location
of the pharmaceutical factory?

191
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:16,920
Chairman!

192
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,450
I swear I didn't leak it!

193
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:24,670
Li Boze,

194
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:26,910
you're awful at sowing discord.

195
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,120
Let me tell you,

196
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:36,030
he really wasn't the one who told me.

197
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,760
The North-South Railway

198
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:40,790
is something my father
fought for his whole life.

199
00:12:40,790 --> 00:12:41,750
I know it

200
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,440
better than you do.

201
00:12:45,670 --> 00:12:47,870
The North-South Railway has 4 stations

202
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:50,480
within 100km outside Nancheng.

203
00:12:50,570 --> 00:12:51,500
[Jiating Station]

204
00:12:51,740 --> 00:12:52,590
[Zhanan Station]

205
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,790
[Qingqu Station]

206
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,850
If the reception time
in all 3 locations is 7 a.m.,

207
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,320
only Yushan Station

208
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:02,970
[Yushan Station]

209
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:01,520
has an early morning departure window.

210
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:07,630
Besides, your factory
consumes a lot of electricity,

211
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:09,000
so it must be close to

212
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,320
the substation east of Yushan Station.

213
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,960
Am I right?

214
00:13:18,870 --> 00:13:20,600
Your pharmaceutical factory,

215
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,030
or rather,

216
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:24,910
your heartless bacteria factory,

217
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,870
can only be built here.

218
00:13:38,030 --> 00:13:38,630
Chairman!

219
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,840
We're under attack!

220
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,100
Protect the Chairman!

221
00:13:52,790 --> 00:13:53,240
Oh no!

222
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,030
Get down!

223
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:22,670
Boss Hai,

224
00:14:22,930 --> 00:14:25,200
Young Marshal told me
to give you this letter.

225
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,150
You can go now.

226
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:27,750
You can go wherever you want.

227
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:34,340
[To Hai Tangqing]

228
00:14:51,270 --> 00:14:52,870
Young Marshal said...

229
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,440
no one...

230
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,320
is allowed in...

231
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,290
Ever since I defected to the enemy,

232
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,740
they kept a constant eye on me.

233
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,910
To pass on a message,

234
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,320
I can only...

235
00:16:08,050 --> 00:16:08,790
Everyone,

236
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,620
giving up the antidote

237
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:13,720
to the aviation school members

238
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,080
means certain death.

239
00:16:16,550 --> 00:16:18,000
This is my final offer.

240
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,480
If you regret it now,

241
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,390
you can still back out.

242
00:16:21,390 --> 00:16:22,670
No regrets!

243
00:16:23,510 --> 00:16:24,570
Protect the people

244
00:16:24,870 --> 00:16:26,030
or die trying!

245
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,510
Protect the people

246
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:28,870
or die trying!

247
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,630
Even if we bear infamy for all eternity!

248
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:33,240
Even if we bear infamy for all eternity!

249
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:34,600
Good!

250
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,480
After this battle,

251
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:56,750
we will

252
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,320
depart from this world.

253
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:06,640
I gift this flag

254
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,349
to all of you.

255
00:17:18,829 --> 00:17:19,680
If injured,

256
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,790
wipe the blood.

257
00:17:23,510 --> 00:17:24,550
If dead,

258
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,200
wrap the corpse!

259
00:17:26,349 --> 00:17:27,270
If injured,

260
00:17:27,270 --> 00:17:28,590
wipe the blood.

261
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:29,590
If dead,

262
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:30,920
wrap the corpse!

263
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,550
Father,

264
00:17:42,110 --> 00:17:42,830
Mother,

265
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:45,510
Qingyu,

266
00:17:49,830 --> 00:17:51,030
I'm joining you soon.

267
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:01,480
♪ Hate is the smoke left by dying flames ♪

268
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:05,090
♪ Love is the warmth
lingering after the wildfire ♪

269
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:08,760
♪ Love and hate collide in a blaze ♪

270
00:18:09,820 --> 00:18:12,830
♪ Devour me all ♪

271
00:18:12,890 --> 00:18:16,190
♪ Ahead lies
a tangle of joys and sorrows ♪

272
00:18:16,710 --> 00:18:19,970
♪ Behind remains
the bitterness of unspoken feelings ♪

273
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:23,410
♪ The heart races with every thought ♪

274
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:26,680
♪ As long as we loved each other,
I don't care ♪

275
00:18:26,890 --> 00:18:29,890
♪ If it's a blessing or a curse ♪

276
00:18:33,010 --> 00:18:36,150
♪ If the sparks ♪

277
00:18:36,210 --> 00:18:38,700
♪ Could fly back into the gun's muzzle ♪

278
00:18:41,180 --> 00:18:46,020
♪ If I had turned away
when love first bloomed ♪

279
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:46,550
Boss Hai,

280
00:18:47,790 --> 00:18:48,720
may this letter find you well.

281
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:54,140
♪ Perhaps I could've
walked away unscathed ♪

282
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,660
As the end approaches,

283
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,730
I finally came to my senses.

284
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:56,070
I am all alone

285
00:18:56,250 --> 00:19:00,800
♪ Sadly, fate leaves no room for "if" ♪

286
